          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On October 28, 1978, around 7:10 PM, several witnesses observed the rapid passage from east to west of a luminous phenomenon in the sky. The witnesses described a fireball with a glowing trail on a horizontal trajectory. No noise was heard during the observation. The phenomenon suddenly faded away. Based on the descriptions, these individuals likely witnessed an atmospheric reentry.",
